      "sc:description": "DANEELpath is an open-source QuPath extension (plug-in) that combines deep learning segmentation and mathematical-morphology pipelines to segment individual and clustered cells and extract spatial features from whole-slide histopathology images, developed for neuroblastoma and 3D biomimetic model research.",
